# PhotoLUT Natural HLG BT.2020
# Original PhotoLUT look. Input/output: HLG-encoded BT.2020 RGB, normalized 0..1.
# Intended for confirmed HLG / BT.2020 / 10-bit footage only.
# Mild scene-linear contrast and saturation; no SDR tone mapping.
# Licensed under the MIT License (see repository LICENSE).
